Description: dts: enable the CV1800B watchdog on the NanoKVM PCIe
 The SoC device tree describes the DesignWare watchdog but leaves it
 disabled, as SoC dtsi files normally do. Enable it for this board so
 /dev/watchdog exists and the watchdog can supervise the system.
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-24
--- a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/sophgo/sg2002-nanokvm-pcie.dts
+++ b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/sophgo/sg2002-nanokvm-pcie.dts
@@ -233,6 +233,10 @@
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&watchdog {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &{/soc} {
 	csi: csi@a0c2000 {
 		compatible = "sophgo,sg2002-csi";
